{%- comment -%}
============================================================
Resoul 發票模板 — Shopify「Order Printer」用（Liquid）
------------------------------------------------------------
用法：Shopify 後台 → Apps → Order Printer → Templates →
      New template（或編輯現有）→ 貼上以下全部內容 → Save。
      列印訂單時揀呢個模板即可。

可自訂項目（見下方 CONFIG）：
  • logo_url        右上角品牌標誌圖片網址
  • signature_url   底部 Resoul 簽名圖片網址
  • brand_tagline   標誌下方標語
  • footer_message  底部溫馨語句
  • footer_contact  底部聯絡資料

欄位對應（自動由訂單帶入）：
  • Invoice No. → 訂單編號 order.order_number
  • Date        → 落單日期 order.created_at
  • Issued to   → 客戶姓名
  • Owner of    → 毛孩名（於訂單「附加資料 / note attributes」加一項
                  名為「Owner of」；亦支援「毛孩名」「Pet」）
  • Phone       → 客戶電話
  • ITEM CODE   → 貨品 SKU
  • DESCRIPTION → 貨品名稱（+ 款式 / 刻字等自訂內容）
  • REMARKS     → 訂單備註 order.note + note attributes
  • DEPOSITS    → 訂金：於訂單附加資料加一項名為「Deposit」（或「訂金」），
                  填數字即可（例：2730）。若未填而訂單已付款，當作全數已付。
  • BALANCE     → 應付餘額 = 小計 − 折扣 − 訂金
============================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} ===== CONFIG（可自行修改）===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign logo_url      = "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0839/2841/6484/files/resoul-wordmark.png?v=1788451690" -%}
{%- assign signature_url = "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0839/2841/6484/files/Sign.png?v=1789201951" -%}
{%- assign brand_tagline = "Your last greatest love to show" -%}
{%- assign footer_message = "May the story of your beloved companion continue to bring warmth to your days." -%}
{%- assign footer_contact = "https://resoul.hk | @resoul_hk | +852 6476 2951 | resoulhk@gmail.com" -%}

{%- comment -%} ===== 讀取訂單附加資料（毛孩名 / 訂金）===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign owner_of = "" -%}
{%- assign deposit_attr = "" -%}
{%- for a in order.note_attributes -%}
  {%- assign attr_name = a.name | default: a.first -%}
  {%- assign attr_value = a.value | default: a.last -%}
  {%- if attr_name == "Owner of" or attr_name == "毛孩名" or attr_name == "Pet" or attr_name == "pet" -%}{%- assign owner_of = attr_value -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- if attr_name == "Deposit" or attr_name == "訂金" or attr_name == "deposit" -%}{%- assign deposit_attr = attr_value -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{%- comment -%} ===== 計算金額（單位：仙 / cents）===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign items_total = 0 -%}
{%- for line_item in order.line_items -%}
  {%- assign items_total = items_total | plus: line_item.line_price -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign net_total = items_total | minus: order.total_discounts -%}
{%- assign deposits = 0 -%}
{%- if deposit_attr != "" -%}
  {%- assign deposits = deposit_attr | times: 100 -%}
{%- elsif order.financial_status == "paid" -%}
  {%- assign deposits = net_total -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign balance = net_total | minus: deposits -%}

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,500&family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@400;500;600&family=Parisienne&display=swap');

  .resoul-invoice * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .resoul-invoice {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Noto Serif TC', 'Times New Roman', serif;
    color: #3a352f;
    background: #fffdf9;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .resoul-invoice .frame-outer { border: 1.5px solid #b7b1a6; padding: 5px; }
  .resoul-invoice .frame-inner { border: 1px solid #d3cdc2; padding: 40px 44px 30px; }

  .resoul-invoice .muted { color: #8a8379; }
  .resoul-invoice .up { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .18em; }

  .resoul-invoice .head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; }
  .resoul-invoice .title-box {
    border: 1px solid #cfc9be; border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 16px 34px; display: inline-block;
  }
  .resoul-invoice .title-box .t {
    font-size: 46px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #4a453e; line-height: 1;
  }
  .resoul-invoice .brand { text-align: right; }
  .resoul-invoice .brand img { height: 74px; width: auto; display: inline-block; }
  .resoul-invoice .brand .tagline { font-style: italic; font-size: 12px; color: #6f6a63; margin-top: 4px; }

  .resoul-invoice .meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 26px; gap: 30px; }
  .resoul-invoice .issued {
    border: 1px solid #cfc9be; border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px 22px;
    min-width: 320px;
  }
  .resoul-invoice .issued .row { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin: 2px 0; }
  .resoul-invoice .issued .k { color: #6f6a63; min-width: 96px; }
  .resoul-invoice .issued .v { color: #3a352f; }
  .resoul-invoice .inv-no { text-align: left; padding-top: 14px; }
  .resoul-invoice .inv-no .row { display: flex; gap: 16px; margin: 3px 0; }
  .resoul-invoice .inv-no .k { color: #6f6a63; min-width: 92px; }

  .resoul-invoice table.items { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; margin-top: 34px; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items .col-code { width: 20%; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items .col-desc { width: 38%; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items .col-price { width: 15%; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items .col-qty { width: 9%; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items .col-sub { width: 18%; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items thead th {
    font-weight: 500; color: #77716a; text-align: left;
    font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase;
    padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4ded4;
  }
  .resoul-invoice table.items th.num, .resoul-invoice table.items td.num { text-align: right; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items th.ctr, .resoul-invoice table.items td.ctr { text-align: center; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items th.col-price, .resoul-invoice table.items td.col-price { padding-right: 26px; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items tbody td { padding: 15px 0; vertical-align: top; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.55; letter-spacing: .01em; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items .code { color: #5f5b55; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .02em; overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; padding-right: 26px; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items .desc { color: #4b463f; padding-left: 8px; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items .li-prop { font-size: 11.5px; color: #8a8379; margin-top: 2px; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items .col-price, .resoul-invoice table.items .col-sub { white-space: nowrap; }
  .resoul-invoice table.items td.num,
  .resoul-invoice table.items td.ctr,
  .resoul-invoice .totals .row .v {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Noto Serif TC', 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-variant-numeric: lining-nums tabular-nums;
    font-feature-settings: "lnum" 1, "tnum" 1;
  }

  .resoul-invoice .foot { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 46px; gap: 40px; }
  .resoul-invoice .remarks { flex: 1 1 auto; max-width: 52%; }
  .resoul-invoice .remarks .h { color: #6f6a63; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .resoul-invoice .remarks .body { color: #4a453e; line-height: 1.6; white-space: pre-wrap; }
  .resoul-invoice .remarks .empty { color: #b0a79a; }
  .resoul-invoice .totals { min-width: 300px; }
  .resoul-invoice .totals .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 22px; padding: 5px 0; }
  .resoul-invoice .totals .row .k { color: #6f6a63; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 12px; }
  .resoul-invoice .totals .row .v { color: #3a352f; white-space: nowrap; }
  .resoul-invoice .totals .balance { border-top: 1px solid #e4ded4; margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 10px; }
  .resoul-invoice .totals .balance .k, .resoul-invoice .totals .balance .v { font-weight: 600; color: #2f2b25; letter-spacing: .08em; }

  .resoul-invoice .sign { text-align: right; margin-top: 24px; }
  .resoul-invoice .sign .signature-img { display: inline-block; width: 190px; max-width: 38%; height: auto; }
  .resoul-invoice .sign .ty { letter-spacing: .3em; color: #5d6f62; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .resoul-invoice .closing { text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; color: #6f6a63; }
  .resoul-invoice .closing .msg { font-size: 14px; }
  .resoul-invoice .closing .contact { font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: .04em; margin-top: 4px; color: #8a8379; }
</style>

<div class="resoul-invoice">
  <div class="frame-outer">
    <div class="frame-inner">

      <div class="head">
        <div class="title-box"><div class="t">INVOICE</div></div>
        <div class="brand">
          {%- if logo_url != "" -%}<img src="{{ logo_url }}" alt="Resoul">{%- else -%}<div class="script" style="font-family:'Parisienne',cursive;font-size:42px;color:#3a352f;">Resoul</div>{%- endif -%}
          <div class="tagline">{{ brand_tagline }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="meta">
        <div class="issued">
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Issued to:</span><span class="v">{{ order.customer.first_name }} {{ order.customer.last_name }}{% if order.customer.first_name == blank and order.customer.last_name == blank %}{{ order.shipping_address.name | default: order.billing_address.name }}{% endif %}</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Owner of:</span><span class="v">{{ owner_of }}</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Phone number:</span><span class="v">{{ order.customer.phone | default: order.shipping_address.phone | default: order.billing_address.phone }}</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="inv-no">
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Invoice No.:</span><span class="v">{{ order.order_number }}</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Date:</span><span class="v">{{ order.created_at | date: "%-d %B %Y" }}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <table class="items">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="col-code">Item Code</th>
            <th class="col-desc">Description</th>
            <th class="col-price num">Unit Price</th>
            <th class="col-qty ctr">Qty</th>
            <th class="col-sub num">Subtotal</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {%- for line_item in order.line_items -%}
          <tr>
            <td class="code">{{ line_item.sku }}</td>
            <td class="desc">
              {{ line_item.title }}
              {%- unless line_item.variant_title == blank or line_item.variant_title == "Default Title" %} <span class="muted">— {{ line_item.variant_title }}</span>{% endunless -%}
              {%- for p in line_item.properties -%}
                {%- unless p.last == blank or p.first == blank -%}
                  {%- assign pf = p.first | slice: 0 -%}
                  {%- unless pf == "_" -%}<div class="li-prop">{{ p.first }}: {{ p.last }}</div>{%- endunless -%}
                {%- endunless -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </td>
            <td class="num col-price">HKD {{ line_item.price | money_without_currency }}</td>
            <td class="ctr">{{ line_item.quantity }}</td>
            <td class="num col-sub">HKD {{ line_item.line_price | money_without_currency }}</td>
          </tr>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="foot">
        <div class="remarks">
          <div class="h">Remarks</div>
          {%- if order.note != blank -%}
            <div class="body">{{ order.note }}</div>
          {%- else -%}
            <div class="body empty">—</div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- for a in order.note_attributes -%}
            {%- assign attr_name = a.name | default: a.first -%}
            {%- assign attr_value = a.value | default: a.last -%}
            {%- unless attr_value == blank or attr_name == "Deposit" or attr_name == "訂金" or attr_name == "deposit" -%}
              <div class="body">{{ attr_name }}: {{ attr_value }}</div>
            {%- endunless -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <div class="totals">
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Total</span><span class="v">HKD {{ items_total | money_without_currency }}</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Discount</span><span class="v">HKD {{ order.total_discounts | money_without_currency }}</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Deposits</span><span class="v">HKD {{ deposits | money_without_currency }}</span></div>
          <div class="row balance"><span class="k">Balance to settle</span><span class="v">HKD {{ balance | money_without_currency }}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sign">
        {%- if signature_url != "" -%}<img class="signature-img" src="{{ signature_url }}" alt="Resoul">{%- else -%}<div class="script">Resoul</div>{%- endif -%}
        <div class="ty">THANK YOU</div>
      </div>
      <div class="closing">
        <div class="msg">{{ footer_message }}</div>
        <div class="contact">{{ footer_contact }}</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
